WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.183
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:10.184 --> 00:00:13.899
I am a mountain gorilla.

3
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:18.304
Gorillas are the biggest kind of apes.

4
00:00:18.305 --> 00:00:21.559
Where do you live?

5
00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:25.978
We live in the mountains of Africa.

6
00:00:25.979 --> 00:00:29.857
Our home is the forest.

7
00:00:29.858 --> 00:00:32.974
Do you make sounds?

8
00:00:32.975 --> 00:00:35.771
We make many sounds.

9
00:00:35.772 --> 00:00:41.723
We hoot and roar when we're mad.

10
00:00:41.724 --> 00:00:49.514
We growl softly when we're happy.

11
00:00:49.515 --> 00:00:55.140
What do you eat?

12
00:00:55.141 --> 00:01:02.779
We mostly eat plants and tree bark.

13
00:01:02.780 --> 00:01:10.142
We really like plants' stems, roots, and leaves.

14
00:01:10.143 --> 00:01:13.804
Do you have any enemies?

15
00:01:13.805 --> 00:01:18.539
People are our main enemy.

16
00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:22.810
They steal our land and hunt us.

17
00:01:22.811 --> 00:01:27.855
But some people try to protect us.

18
00:01:27.856 --> 00:01:30.977
Do you live alone?

19
00:01:30.978 --> 00:01:34.797
No, we live in groups.

20
00:01:34.798 --> 00:01:37.489
See the baby?

21
00:01:37.490 --> 00:01:42.072
Young gorillas love to play!

22
00:01:42.073 --> 00:01:45.498
Who's in charge?

23
00:01:45.499 --> 00:01:49.500
The big silverback is our boss.

24
00:01:49.501 --> 00:01:52.277
He's the oldest male.

25
00:01:52.278 --> 00:02:00.719
He tells us what to do.

26
00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:04.585
I hear the silverback calling me now.

27
00:02:04.586 --> 00:02:06.879
Good-bye!

28
00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:15.482
Good-bye, Mountain Gorilla!

